---

---
  <section style="background-color: #252525;" class="text-white min-h-screen py-16 px-6 items-center">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center lg:mt-10 lg:pt-10">
      
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-3/4 lg:h-1/2 p-0">
        <div class="w-full aspect-video">
          <iframe 
            class="w-full h-full rounded-md"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ"
            title="YouTube video player"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
            allowfullscreen>
          </iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">
          IMPACT BEYOND WORDS
          <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-orange-500 mt-1"></div>
        </h2>
  
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-[2]">
          We don’t just manage brands, we shape how the world <br>
          sees them. Every pixel, every post, every campaign is <br>
          crafted with precision, turning noise into influence. From <br>
          viral social campaigns to compelling brand storytelling, <br>
          <b>We Make Sure Your Message Isn’t Just Seen, It’s<br>
             Remembered.</b> In a world of distractions, we create <br>
             impact. Simple. Bold. Unforgettable.
        </p>
  
        <!-- Buttons -->
        <div class="flex gap-4 mt-4">
          <button style="background-color:#F56416;" class="bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded">Make a Call</button>
          <button style="background-color:#000000; hover:background-color:#F56416; border-color:#F56416;color:#F56416" class="border px-4 py-2 rounded">Our Services</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  